msgid "原 source、scope、receipt；文档更新不继承资格"
msgstr ""
"Original source, scope and receipts; documentation updates inherit no "
"qualification"

msgid ""
"迁移应同时改变配置、接口访问、存储所有权与停止流程，然后对迁移后的源码与 装配重新验证。旧参数、旧 object ID 和相邻配置的结果不能继承到新 "
"bundle。"
msgstr ""
"Migration changes configuration, interface access, storage ownership and "
"shutdown together, then revalidates the migrated source and assembly. Old "
"parameters, object IDs and neighboring configuration results do not transfer"
" to a new bundle."

msgid "获取冻结的旧资料"
msgstr "Obtain frozen historical material"

msgid ""
"历史设计、执行台账、归档和原始状态页保存在 [固定 Git 提交](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/83a27dfbee4e8fbf4d35875b1e9db85af7516eec)。 "
"当前源码目录只保留维护中的平台实现、合同和使用指南。阅读历史结果时确认完整提交、 配置和产物身份；旧结果不赋予当前源码任何验证资格。"
msgstr ""
"Historical designs, execution ledgers, archives and original status pages "
"remain at a [fixed Git commit](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/83a27dfbee4e8fbf4d35875b1e9db85af7516eec). The current tree "
"retains maintained platform implementations, contracts and user guides. "
"Check the full commit, configuration and artifact identities when reading "
"historical results; they grant no validation to current source."

msgid "文档路径与版本"
msgstr "Documentation paths and versions"

msgid ""
"当前站点使用 `en/`、`zh_CN/` 和 `api/` 入口。已退役文档的原始路径通过固定 Git 版本读取；当前工具不再生成旧 URL "
"alias、归档恢复包和候选晋升记录。 迁移后的产品应依照当前公共头、配置 schema 和生命周期合同重新验证。"
msgstr ""
"The current site uses `en/`, `zh_CN/` and `api/` entry points. Read retired "
"documents at their original paths in fixed Git revisions. Current tools no "
"longer generate legacy URL aliases, archive recovery bundles or candidate-"
"promotion records. Revalidate migrated products against the current public "
"headers, configuration schema and lifecycle contracts."
